  "question": {
    "text": "If the forward voltage in a semiconductor diode is changed from $0.5 \\mathrm{~V}$ to $0.7 \\mathrm{~V}$, then the forward current changes by $1.0 \\mathrm{~mA}$. The forward resistance of diode junction will be",
